{"id":"n74125-1-10","stage":1,"title":"혀 · 舌头","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74125-1-10-1","ko":"승규가 술을 많이 마셨네.","zh":"承奎喝了不少酒啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"술을","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마셨네.","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/770f4300a701c21c816b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74125-1-10-2","ko":"취해 가지고 혀가 꼬여서 말도 잘 못 하는군.","zh":"喝醉了，舌头都不利索，说话也说不清楚呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"취해","meaning":"醉","explanation":"취하다：醉；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"취하다","audio":"/audio/bace132cddc63e17f409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66313","senseId":"1","lemma":"취하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"表示前面提到的行动或状态成为后面内容的原因、手段或理由。","explanation":"가지다：表示前面提到的行动或状态成为后面内容的原因、手段或理由。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61191","senseId":"2","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혀가","meaning":"舌头","explanation":"혀：舌头；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"혀","audio":"/audio/7276b07033008ecc9f5a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74125","senseId":"1","lemma":"혀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼬여서","meaning":"扭曲","explanation":"꼬이다：扭曲；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"꼬이다","audio":"/audio/ad7c2f23abc7ed80c0a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40666","senseId":"2","lemma":"꼬이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말도","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는군.","meaning":"说话（말을 하다）","explanation":"하다：说话（말을 하다）；는군：对新发现或刚得知的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bace132cddc63e17","term":"취하다","zh":"醉","audio":"/audio/bace132cddc63e17f409.mp3","entryId":"66313","definition":"由于酒劲或药劲而精神恍惚，身体无法正常行动。","pronunciation":["취ː하다"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"表示前面提到的行动或状态成为后面内容的原因、手段或理由。","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"61191","definition":"表示前面提到的行动或状态成为后面内容的原因、手段或理由。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"7276b07033008ecc","term":"혀","zh":"舌头","audio":"/audio/7276b07033008ecc9f5a.mp3","entryId":"74125","definition":"人或者动物嘴下方的长红色肉块。","pronunciation":["혀"]},{"id":"ad7c2f23abc7ed80","term":"꼬이다","zh":"扭曲","audio":"/audio/ad7c2f23abc7ed80c0a7.mp3","entryId":"40666","definition":"身体的一部分缠着或绞着。","pronunciation":["꼬이다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"说话（말을 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"说话（말을 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/875b35cd59b8b1397252.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.902,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74125","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":58,"sequenceScore":2.7287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["喝醉了，舌头都不利索，说话也说不清楚呢。","听说你的网站很受欢迎啊？","承奎喝了不少酒啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["喝醉了，舌头都不利索，说话也说不清楚呢。","承奎喝了不少酒啊。","听说你的网站很受欢迎啊？"],"answer":0}]}
